{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Navigate"},{"type":"text","value":" component is a component that can be used to navigate to a new location when rendered. This includes changes to the pathname, search params, hash, and location state. The underlying navigation will happen inside of a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useEffect"},{"type":"text","value":" hook when successfully rendered."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"navigate-props","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Navigate props"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Navigate"},{"type":"text","value":" component accepts the following props:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"...options"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"link","href":"./NavigateOptionsType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"NavigateOptions"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"navigate-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Navigate returns"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"null"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"navigate-props","text":"Navigate props","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"...options","level":3},{"id":"navigate-returns","text":"Navigate returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `Navigate` component is a component that can be used to navigate to a new location when rendered. This includes changes to the pathname, search params, hash, and location state. The underlying navigation will happen inside of a `useEffect` hook when successfully rendered.\n\n## Navigate props\n\nThe `Navigate` component accepts the following props:\n\n### `...options`\n\n- Type: [`NavigateOptions`](./NavigateOptionsType.md)\n\n## Navigate returns\n\n- `null`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: navigateComponent\ntitle: Navigate component\n---\n\nThe `Navigate` component is a component that can be used to navigate to a new location when rendered. This includes changes to the pathname, search params, hash, and location state. The underlying navigation will happen inside of a `useEffect` hook when successfully rendered.\n\n## Navigate props\n\nThe `Navigate` component accepts the following props:\n\n### `...options`\n\n- Type: [`NavigateOptions`](./NavigateOptionsType.md)\n\n## Navigate returns\n\n- `null`\n"}
